# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://suffolkcrawlspace.com/* https://suffolkcrawlspace.com/:splat 301

# Redirect www to non-www
https://www.suffolkcrawlspace.com/* https://suffolkcrawlspace.com/:splat 301

